#: templates/school/about.html:3 templates/school/about.html:5
msgid "Get to know the people, principles and purpose behind Wisdom School."
msgstr ""
"Wisdom School ortidagi insonlar, tamoyillar va maqsadlar bilan tanishing."

#: templates/school/about.html:5
msgid "Our school"
msgstr "Bizning maktab"

#: templates/school/about.html:5
msgid "Rooted in values."
msgstr "Qadriyatlarga tayangan."

#: templates/school/about.html:5
msgid "Open to possibility."
msgstr "Imkoniyatlarga ochiq."

#: templates/school/about.html:10
msgid "School courtyard"
msgstr "Maktab hovlisi"

#: templates/school/about.html:13
msgid "An education with"
msgstr "Maqsad va qalb bilan"

#: templates/school/about.html:13
msgid "purpose and heart."
msgstr "beriladigan ta’lim."

#: templates/school/about.html:14
msgid ""
"We believe a school should open doors — to new knowledge, new perspectives "
"and a deeper understanding of ourselves."
msgstr ""
"Biz maktab eshiklarni ochishi kerak deb hisoblaymiz — yangi bilimlarga, "
"yangi qarashlarga va o‘zimizni chuqurroq anglashga."

#: templates/school/about.html:15
msgid ""
"Wisdom School brings academic learning together with character, creativity "
"and community. Here, students are encouraged to work hard, think "
"independently and treat others with care."
msgstr ""
"Wisdom School akademik ta’limni xarakter, ijodkorlik va hamjamiyat bilan "
"birlashtiradi. Bu yerda o‘quvchilar astoydil mehnat qilish, mustaqil "
"fikrlash va boshqalarga g‘amxo‘rlik bilan munosabatda bo‘lishga undaladi."

#: templates/school/about.html:22
msgid "The values we live"
msgstr "Biz amal qiladigan qadriyatlar"

#: templates/school/about.html:23
msgid "What matters stays with us."
msgstr "Muhim narsalar biz bilan qoladi."

#: templates/school/about.html:25
msgid "Curiosity"
msgstr "Qiziquvchanlik"

#: templates/school/about.html:25
msgid "Ask questions. Look closer. Find delight in discovering something new."
msgstr ""
"Savol bering. Diqqat bilan qarang. Yangi narsa kashf etishdan zavq oling."

#: templates/school/about.html:26
msgid "Integrity"
msgstr "Halollik"

#: templates/school/about.html:26
msgid ""
"Act with honesty, take responsibility and do the right thing with courage."
msgstr ""
"Halol harakat qiling, mas’uliyatni zimmangizga oling va to‘g‘ri ishni "
"jasorat bilan qiling."

#: templates/school/about.html:27
msgid "Respect"
msgstr "Hurmat"

#: templates/school/about.html:27
msgid "Listen with an open mind and value the different people around you."
msgstr ""
"Ochiq fikr bilan tinglang va atrofingizdagi turli insonlarni qadrlang."

#: templates/school/about.html:28
msgid "Ambition"
msgstr "Intilish"

#: templates/school/about.html:28
msgid "Set meaningful goals and keep growing through effort and reflection."
msgstr ""
"Mazmunli maqsadlar qo‘ying va mehnat hamda mulohaza orqali o‘sishda davom "
"eting."

#: templates/school/about.html:36
msgid "Our approach"
msgstr "Bizning yondashuv"

#: templates/school/about.html:37
msgid "The whole child."
msgstr "Bolani butunligicha."

#: templates/school/about.html:37
msgid "The bigger picture."
msgstr "Keng manzarada."

#: templates/school/about.html:38
msgid "An environment where achievement and wellbeing belong together."
msgstr "Yutuq va farovonlik birga yuradigan muhit."

#: templates/school/about.html:41
msgid "Learning that goes deeper"
msgstr "Chuqurroq ta’lim"

#: templates/school/about.html:41
msgid ""
"Rich subject knowledge, thoughtful discussion and the confidence to ask why."
msgstr ""
"Fanlar bo‘yicha boy bilim, mazmunli muhokama va «nega?» deb so‘rashga "
"jur’at."

#: templates/school/about.html:42
msgid "Care that makes a difference"
msgstr "Ahamiyatli g‘amxo‘rlik"

#: templates/school/about.html:42
msgid ""
"A culture of belonging, where students feel seen, supported and safe to try."
msgstr ""
"O‘quvchilar o‘zini ko‘rilgan, qo‘llab-quvvatlangan va sinab ko‘rishga "
"xavfsiz his qiladigan muhit."

#: templates/school/about.html:43
msgid "A community that grows together"
msgstr "Birga o‘sadigan hamjamiyat"

#: templates/school/about.html:43
msgid "A close partnership between students, educators and families."
msgstr "O‘quvchilar, ustozlar va oilalar o‘rtasidagi yaqin hamkorlik."

#: templates/school/academics.html:3 templates/school/academics.html:5
msgid ""
"A thoughtful balance of academic challenge, creative exploration and "
"personal growth."
msgstr ""
"Akademik sinovlar, ijodiy izlanish va shaxsiy o‘sish o‘rtasidagi puxta "
"muvozanat."

#: templates/school/academics.html:5
msgid "A strong foundation."
msgstr "Mustahkam poydevor."

#: templates/school/academics.html:5
msgid "A limitless outlook."
msgstr "Cheksiz ufqlar."

#: templates/school/academics.html:11
msgid "A continuous learning journey"
msgstr "Uzluksiz ta’lim yo‘li"

#: templates/school/academics.html:12
msgid "Different stages. One shared ambition."
msgstr "Turli bosqichlar. Yagona umumiy maqsad."

#: templates/school/academics.html:30
msgid "Beyond the classroom"
msgstr "Sinfdan tashqarida"

#: templates/school/academics.html:31
msgid "Where interests"
msgstr "Qiziqishlar"

#: templates/school/academics.html:31
msgid "become passions."
msgstr "ishtiyoqqa aylanadigan joy."

#: templates/school/academics.html:32
msgid ""
"Space to experiment, create, move and lead. Enrichment gives students more "
"ways to discover their strengths."
msgstr ""
"Tajriba qilish, ijod qilish, harakatlanish va yetakchilik uchun makon. "
"To‘garaklar o‘quvchilarga o‘z kuchli tomonlarini kashf etishning ko‘proq "
"yo‘llarini beradi."

#: templates/school/academics.html:34
msgid "STEM & robotics"
msgstr "STEM va robototexnika"

#: templates/school/academics.html:35
msgid "Chess & strategic thinking"
msgstr "Shaxmat va strategik fikrlash"

#: templates/school/academics.html:36
msgid "Creative arts & expression"
msgstr "Ijodiy san’at va o‘zini ifodalash"

#: templates/school/academics.html:37
msgid "Sport & wellbeing"
msgstr "Sport va salomatlik"

#: templates/school/academics.html:40
msgid "Collaborative science learning"
msgstr "Fanni birgalikda o‘rganish"

#: templates/school/academics.html:45
msgid "A day at Wisdom"
msgstr "Wisdom’da bir kun"

#: templates/school/academics.html:46
msgid "Purpose in every part of the day."
msgstr "Kunning har bir qismida maqsad."

#: templates/school/academics.html:48
msgid "Connect"
msgstr "Bog‘lanish"

#: templates/school/academics.html:48
msgid "A welcoming start, time to check in and prepare for learning."
msgstr "Iliq boshlanish, salomlashish va darsga tayyorlanish vaqti."

#: templates/school/academics.html:49
msgid "Focused lessons, lively questions and practical discovery."
msgstr "Diqqatli darslar, jonli savollar va amaliy kashfiyotlar."

#: templates/school/academics.html:50
msgid "Create"
msgstr "Ijod"

#: templates/school/academics.html:50
